# Toolchain & Project Structure

## Language

**C11** (`-std=c11`). **No C++.**

## Compiler flags (from `Makefile`)

```
-std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror
-D_POSIX_C_SOURCE=200809L
-Iinclude
-O2          # release
```

Debug target adds `-g -O1 -fsanitize=address,undefined -fno-omit-frame-pointer`.

## Compiler selection

`Makefile` picks **gcc** if available, else **clang**:

```makefile
CC := $(shell command -v gcc >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo gcc || echo clang)
```

## Build system

**GNU Make** at repo root. Separate compile (`.o`) and link steps. All artefacts under **`build/`**.

| Target | Output |
|--------|--------|
| `make` / `all` | `build/date-toto` |
| `make debug` | `build/date-toto-debug` |
| `make test` | builds + runs `build/tests/test_core` |
| `make clean` | removes objects/binaries under `build/`; keeps `.gitkeep` |
| `make install` | `install -m 755 build/date-toto /usr/local/bin` (Linux/macOS; needs sudo) |

**Main sources:** `src/main.c`, `src/date_toto_emit.c`, `src/date_toto_write.c`, `src/date_toto_fmt.c`, `src/date_toto_parse.c`, `src/date_toto_cli.c` → objects `build/*.o`

**Test sources:** `tests/test_runner.c`, `tests/test_civil_epoch_zero.c`, `tests/test_civil_roundtrip.c`, `tests/test_civil_leap_year.c`, `tests/test_civil_offset.c`, `tests/test_civil_ub_note.c` → objects `build/tests/*.o`

## Dependencies

**libc only** — no extra `-l` flags. POSIX headers: `unistd.h`, `signal.h`, `time.h`, `sys/stat.h`, etc.

